{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"MRK","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛ","commonName":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛ","title":"ᤔᤷᤁᤢᤛᤖᤧ ᤛᤠᤵᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ","order":41,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"b2060868822844e783adc1c46e31426b08db82e9e63c16700ae81ee716def694","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MRK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MRK/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":661},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤄᤠᤛᤧᤴ ᤗᤥ᤺ᤴᤍᤢ᤹"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤁᤢᤏᤠᤶᤍᤠ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤂᤠᤀᤥ᤺ᤳᤋᤧᤖ ᤐᤳᤇᤧᤸᤗᤧᤛᤠ ᤋᤢᤶᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹. ᤕᤜᤢᤍᤡ ᤋᤢᤶᤗᤠᤶᤗᤥ᤺ᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹. ᤛᤠᤶᤕᤥᤌᤡᤶᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤢ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤕᤰᤆᤢᤶᤓᤥᤒᤠ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤆᤢᤶᤗᤢᤱ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤧ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤀᤡᤔᤧᤄᤣ᤺ᤰᤂᤢ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤖᤥᤔᤡ ᤛᤢᤜᤠᤱᤃᤧᤶᤒᤠ ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤥ",{"noteId":37},"ᤔᤧᤍᤣ᤹ᤖᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤀᤰᤂᤣ ᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢᤖ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤴᤍᤥᤛᤢ. “ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ ᤕᤜᤢᤍᤡ ᤜᤠᤱᤏᤧᤒᤡ᥅” ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤏᤥᤃᤵ ᤐᤡᤖᤢ. “ᤂᤧᤱᤃ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ᤀᤣ ᤁᤧᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤖ ᤁᤧᤒᤳᤗᤥ॥”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤋᤢᤶᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤛᤠᤶᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤥ ᤀᤠᤵᤋᤡᤰ ᤔᤧᤃᤢ᤺ᤳᤋᤢ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤧ ᤕᤠᤶᤔᤥ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤴᤍᤥᤛᤢ. “ᤀᤥᤔᤧᤳᤋᤧ᤹. ᤁᤶᤔᤩᤠᤰ ᤕᤖᤡᤰ ᤀᤠᤵᤋᤡᤰ ᤁᤧᤶᤃᤢ᤺ᤳᤋᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤘᤠ᤹ᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ ᤌᤣᤀᤠᤱ ᤁᤧᤶᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤏᤧᤴᤒᤠᤒᤣ᥅”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤌᤣᤀᤠᤱ ᤏᤥᤃᤵ ᤔᤧᤒᤡᤖᤢᤴᤏᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤔᤕᤧᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"heading","content":["ᤐᤡᤗᤠᤋᤛᤖᤧ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ᤺ᤴ ᤛᤡ᤺ᤔᤧᤸᤗᤧᤴ ᤂᤢᤶᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤡᤖᤢ᤹"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["ᤀᤠᤸᤗ ᤕᤜᤢᤍ